#: ../../source/install/index.md:1 e70ba85150b94681827ffa9de163a179
msgid "安装"
msgstr "Installation"

#: ../../source/install/index.md:3 0c46224f21d94242b2bdf210591aceaa
msgid "NepTrain 要求 Python 3.10 或更高版本："
msgstr "NepTrain requires Python 3.10 or later:"

#: ../../source/install/index.md:5 47b150be73af420490aba2dcff820047
msgid "pip install NepTrain\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/install/index.md:9 77dd58bc2f7f493c86e5ec9bae825395
msgid "TorchNEP："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/install/index.md:11 8f2a3ccb505f4da9b66b50f0c4d1fc3b
msgid ""
"pip install torch\n"
"pip install 'NepTrain[torchnep]'\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/install/index.md:16 c039247582f54d8baef21c3e3018bc96
msgid "MACE Teacher 蒸馏标注："
msgstr "MACE teacher distillation:"

#: ../../source/install/index.md:18 a9d23241dd304f0b8303bfb98854a57d
msgid "pip install 'NepTrain[mace]'\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/install/index.md:22 d5da4472e7574059887346d272145781
msgid ""
"该 extra 提供 NepTrain 内部 MACE 标注适配器所需的运行时。请先按机器 CUDA 版本安装 PyTorch，再安装此 "
"extra。"
msgstr ""
"This extra provides the runtime required by NepTrain’s internal MACE "
"labeling adapter. Install the PyTorch build that matches your CUDA "
"environment before installing this extra."

#: ../../source/install/index.md:25 4ea9a140c2c5401382626f1a7cf786b1
msgid "DeepMD / DPA Teacher 蒸馏标注："
msgstr "DeepMD / DPA teacher distillation:"

#: ../../source/install/index.md:27 ee4546c5f9164310b1f5b965459c6cf1
msgid "pip install 'NepTrain[deepmd]'\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/install/index.md:31 fba5db4dd3664d55b9a9da9a0df670eb
msgid ""
"该 extra 安装 NepTrain 内部 DeepMD 标注适配器所需的稳定版 DeePMD-kit PyTorch 后端。它支持 DPA-3"
" 和其它稳定版 DeepMD 模型。DPA-4 从 DeePMD-kit 3.2 开始提供；在 3.2 仍为预发布版时需显式安装："
msgstr ""
"This extra installs the stable DeePMD-kit PyTorch backend required by "
"NepTrain’s internal DeepMD labeling adapter. It supports DPA-3 and other "
"models supported by stable DeePMD-kit releases. DPA-4 is available "
"starting with DeePMD-kit 3.2; while 3.2 remains a prerelease, install it "
"explicitly:"

#: ../../source/install/index.md:35 3dcc5b85632844dd8956ce791804cdba
msgid ""
"pip install --pre 'deepmd-kit[torch]>=3.2.0b0,<4'\n"
"pip install NepTrain\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/install/index.md:40 c5ea13353268492e8241228f12ce9686
msgid "TACE Teacher 蒸馏标注目前按官方仓库安装。本项目教程固定到已核对 `tace-eval` 接口的 commit："
msgstr ""
"TACE teacher distillation currently uses the official source repository. "
"This tutorial pins the commit whose `tace-eval` interface was verified:"

#: ../../source/install/index.md:43 427d040331d648ca94df334ca1e8a59d
msgid ""
"pip install \\\n"
"  'TACE @ "
"git+https://github.com/xvzemin/tace.git@4b977dcc13ee87d8ba6cceba3ffb7abe43c087c8'"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"pip install \\\n"
"  'TACE @ "
"git+https://github.com/xvzemin/tace.git@4b977dcc13ee87d8ba6cceba3ffb7abe43c087c8'"
"\n"

#: ../../source/install/index.md:48 1bc45bc2d05d4ea5ac98157ac4845b9a
msgid "CUDA 12 环境可选安装 cuEquivariance 加速依赖："
msgstr "CUDA 12 environments can optionally install cuEquivariance acceleration:"

#: ../../source/install/index.md:50 6b3b921fe40a40d69d5a40621fd6d78d
msgid ""
"pip install \\\n"
"  'TACE[cueq12] @ "
"git+https://github.com/xvzemin/tace.git@4b977dcc13ee87d8ba6cceba3ffb7abe43c087c8'"
"\n"
"export TACE_USE_CUE=1\n"
msgstr ""
"pip install \\\n"
"  'TACE[cueq12] @ "
"git+https://github.com/xvzemin/tace.git@4b977dcc13ee87d8ba6cceba3ffb7abe43c087c8'"
"\n"
"export TACE_USE_CUE=1\n"

#: ../../source/install/index.md:56 48aca5cf680340d1b19903d494fcc01c
msgid ""
"官方二进制算子需要 Ampere 或更新的 GPU；Sai V100 实测会报 "
"`cudaErrorNoKernelImageForDevice`，不要在 V100 上启用。"
msgstr ""
"The official binary operators require an Ampere-or-newer GPU. On a Sai "
"V100 they fail with `cudaErrorNoKernelImageForDevice`; do not enable them "
"on V100."

#: ../../source/install/index.md:59 0efc325d763f45a5b74213bfbebef403
msgid "手动采样不提供 NEP 模型、需要 SOAP 描述符时："
msgstr "If manual sampling has no NEP model and must use SOAP descriptors:"

#: ../../source/install/index.md:61 b8b57abae80a460db485c75d2858dfb7
msgid "pip install 'NepTrain[soap]'\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/install/index.md:65 a20682bf0b7e4962aa93c4981328cd06
msgid ""
"LAMMPS、VASP、ABACUS 和赝势由用户或计算平台提供。推荐把 module、PATH 和 `LAMMPS_PLUGIN_PATH` "
"写入 execution target 的 `setup_script`，然后运行："
msgstr ""
"LAMMPS, VASP, ABACUS, and pseudopotentials are supplied by the user or "
"computing platform. Put module commands, PATH changes, and "
"`LAMMPS_PLUGIN_PATH` in the execution target’s `setup_script`, then run:"

#: ../../source/install/index.md:68 86779b39f6ec47f1963c730e556e0c49
msgid "neptrain doctor --project project.yaml\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/install/index.md:72 c1ca08a6951b45b8a63d8a929f8536c9
msgid ""
"`doctor` 会从项目读取 training、MD、labeling backend、stage target、 `setup_script`"
" 和 `environment`，分别在实际目标环境检查 `nep`/TorchNEP、 GPUMD/LAMMPS、VASP/ABACUS 或 "
"MACE/DeepMD/TACE；通常不需要再手写 backend 参数。"
msgstr ""
"`doctor` reads the training, MD, and labeling backends, stage targets, "
"`setup_script`, and `environment` from the project. It checks "
"`nep`/TorchNEP, GPUMD/LAMMPS, VASP/ABACUS, or MACE/DeepMD/TACE in each "
"actual target environment, so backend flags are normally unnecessary."

#: ../../source/install/index.md:77 459002b4e3504ebf92ccf1c501aa6ab7
msgid ""
"NepTrain 不再读取 `~/.NepTrain` 中的旧环境配置。所有可复现执行环境都应进入 schema-v8 "
"`project.yaml` 的 target 或对应环境脚本。"
msgstr ""
"NepTrain no longer reads legacy environment settings from `~/.NepTrain`. "
"Put every reproducible execution setting in a schema-v8 `project.yaml` "
"target or its setup script."
